## 9. Compliance & Standards

### OWASP Top 10 Mitigation

```
1. ✓ Injection: Parameterized queries, input validation
2. ✓ Broken Auth: HTTPS, secure sessions
3. ✓ XSS: CSP headers, input sanitization
4. ✓ CSRF: Tokens, SameSite cookies
5. ✓ XXE: No XML parsing
6. ✓ Broken Access: IAM policies, least privilege
7. ✓ Insecure Config: Automated security checks
8. ✓ Insecure Deserialization: JSON only
9. ✓ Logging: CloudTrail, CloudWatch
10. ✓ Vulnerable Dependencies: Regular updates
```

### Industry Standards

