## 12. Incident Response Plan

### Breach Scenario

```
1. Detection
   └─→ CloudWatch alertas
   └─→ Manual review de logs

2. Immediate Actions
   └─→ Isolar recursos afetados
   └─→ Revogar credenciais comprometidas
   └─→ Notificar usuários

3. Investigation
   └─→ Revisar CloudTrail logs
   └─→ Analisar access logs
   └─→ Determinar causa raiz

4. Recovery
   └─→ Restaurar de backup
   └─→ Patchear vulnerabilidade
   └─→ Re-deploy

5. Post-Incident
   └─→ Documentar lições
   └─→ Atualizar policies
   └─→ Comunicar stakeholders
```

